        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ゲシュペンス島へとやってきた、\nヒーローに憧れるモンスター娘の風神娘、シナツさん。\nそんな彼女は……なぜか僕に纏わりついていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "775908f4dee1bb6d705eab0024f4588f65270b35e0026e9469e211e5570e3b72",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "なぁ、リーダー！　りぃいいいだぁああああ！\nヒーロー活動しようよー！　こんな、ダラダラしてても、\n平和なんて訪れないぞー！",
      "jp_sha256": "7ec65219c0438a44f9e86a2fef1def462559a768d8133210481cbc0cfb050279",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "있지, 리더!　리이이이더어어어!\n히어로 활동하자―!　이렇게 빈둥거려서는\n평화 같은 건 찾아오지 않는다고―!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b005-20261106-resume-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
