      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "……ええっと、僕って必要ありますかね？\nヒーロー活動ならシナツさんだけでも……。",
      "jp_sha256": "b6909573ae165129adfdf8eecdff6e7f9ab21c7d9bcff5b3412771f8c0701b6d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "……그러니까 제가 꼭 필요한가요?\n히어로 활동이라면 시나츠 씨 혼자서도…….",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
