      "serialized_row_index": 15,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "思い付きで僕を連れ回そうとしているかと思いきや、\nちゃんと考えた上で誘っていたようだ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7111b7a0f04dd1fd28dd0b6e2db4bbaf1f8c7d063eed9ce2e26145710e8c2365",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "だから、ヒーロー活動しようよ～！\n思いつかないなら、リーダーが困ってること、\n僕が解決してあげようか？",
      "jp_sha256": "60c360cb1a757c4faf0e496bf836fa4775329691a5baacdf403fd02e2481d01c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그러니까 히어로 활동하자―!\n생각나는 게 없다면 리더가 곤란한 일을\n내가 해결해 줄까?",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
